                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Doug Oucharek &amp;lt;doug.s.oucharek@intel.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/159a51d6-ddf3-11e6-9869-5254006e85c2" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/159a51d6-ddf3-11e6-9869-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test node-provisioning_1 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Failed to provision nodes: lustre-master-el7-x86_64-vs-lustre-upstream-reviews-el7-x86_64--review-ldiskfs--1.1.1 #21: Node provisioning timed out
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please provide additional information about the failure here.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Info required for matching: node-provisioning-1 node-provisioning_1&lt;/p&gt;</description>
